{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1552"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/film","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__film.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",114],["+","Sometimes the return is almost silent: when Mark Hamill reappeared as Luke Skywalker at the very end of „Star Wars: The Force Awakens“, he had 0 lines of dialogue. "],["=",270],["+","The plot itself is driven by a newcomer: the ball-shaped droid BB-8, to whom the pilot Poe Dameron entrusts a piece of the map to Luke Skywalker, and which carries it through the whole film. "],["=",150],["-","T-1000"],["+","T-1000,"],["=",1],["+","a relentless shape-shifting killer played by Robert Patrick, "],["=",529]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",108],["+","Manchmal verläuft die Rückkehr fast stumm: Als Mark Hamill ganz am Ende von „Star Wars: Das Erwachen der Macht“ wieder als Luke Skywalker auftauchte, hatte er 0 Zeilen Text. "],["=",258],["+","Die Handlung selbst treibt ein Neuling voran: der kugelförmige Droide BB-8, dem der Pilot Poe Dameron ein Stück der Karte zu Luke Skywalker anvertraut und der es den ganzen Film über bei sich trägt. "],["=",148],["-","Metall"],["+","Metall,"],["=",1],["+","ein unerbittlicher, gestaltwandelnder Killer, gespielt von Robert Patrick, "],["=",533]]}]},
